meta {
  name: 34 Get Accession Settings
  type: http
  seq: 34
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/accession/settings
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

tests {
  test("200 OK", function () {
    expect(res.getStatus()).to.equal(200);
  });
  test("returns the effective Accession Module Settings", function () {
    const d = res.getBody().data;
    expect(d).to.have.property("MasterData_TubeTypes");
    expect(d).to.have.property("SampleBarcodeSettings_Preview");
    expect(d).to.have.property("Accession_MaximumTimeToAcceptSampleMinutes");
  });
}

docs {
  Effective Accession Module Settings for the active branch (LIMS Settings
  Master — Accession Module) — the branch's saved `AccessionSetting` merged
  over the module defaults. Every field follows the `HeadingName_SettingName`
  convention:

  **Master Data** (string[] lists, persisted as JSON; the sanctioned source
  for the Sample/Transfer action-modal dropdowns):
  `MasterData_TubeTypes`, `MasterData_SampleConditions`,
  `MasterData_RepeatReasons`, `MasterData_ErrorReasons`,
  `MasterData_HoldReasons`, `MasterData_DiscardMethods`,
  `MasterData_RejectionReasons` (shared by Internal/External Referral &
  Outsource reject flows), `MasterData_LogisticsTypes`.

  **Sample Barcode Settings** (typed columns):
  `SampleBarcodeSettings_Prefix`, `SampleBarcodeSettings_Suffix`,
  `SampleBarcodeSettings_Separator` (`NONE`/`HYPHEN`/`SLASH`/`UNDERSCORE`),
  `SampleBarcodeSettings_NumberLength` (4-10),
  `SampleBarcodeSettings_ResetInterval` (`NEVER`/`DAILY`/`MONTHLY`/`YEARLY`),
  `SampleBarcodeSettings_CurrentNumber` (system-managed, read-only),
  `SampleBarcodeSettings_LastResetAt` (system-managed, read-only),
  `SampleBarcodeSettings_Preview` (computed, read-only — e.g. "SBC-000001-AM").

  **Accession** (TAT / acceptance-window / barcode-mapping toggles, typed
  columns): `Accession_MinimumTimeToAcceptSampleMinutes`,
  `Accession_MaximumTimeToAcceptSampleMinutes`,
  `Accession_WarningThresholdMinutes` / `Accession_CriticalThresholdMinutes`
  (minutes remaining before the maximum accept time — a sample breaches
  automatically once the maximum elapses, so there is no separate "breach"
  field), `Accession_InternalReferralAcceptanceThresholdMinutes`,
  `Accession_ExternalReferralAcceptanceThresholdMinutes`, and 7 booleans:
  `Accession_AllowSampleBarcodeMappingBeforeAcceptInhouseOrders`,
  `..BeforeAcceptInternalReferralOrders`, `..BeforeAcceptExternalReferralOrders`,
  `..AfterAcceptInhouseOrders`, `..AfterAcceptInternalReferralOrders`,
  `..AfterAcceptExternalReferralOrders`, `Accession_AllowSampleBarcodeMappingForOutsourceOrders`.
}
